{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"1813d263c26e831c2567d2bb1a86aceeba0ff4bca2eb75bd8e33b93483b09179","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["智慧人的作為"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"當將你的糧食撒在水面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為日久必能得着。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要分給七人，或分給八人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你不知道將來有甚麼災禍臨到地上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雲若滿了雨，就必傾倒在地上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"樹若向南倒，或向北倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"樹倒在何處，就存在何處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看風的，必不撒種；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"望雲的，必不收割。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["風從何道來，骨頭在懷孕婦人的胎中如何長成，你尚且不得知道；這樣，行萬事之上帝的作為，你更不得知道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["早晨要撒你的種，晚上也不要歇你的手，因為你不知道哪一樣發旺；或是早撒的，或是晚撒的，或是兩樣都好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["光本是佳美的，眼見日光也是可悅的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["人活多年，就當快樂多年；然而也當想到黑暗的日子。因為這日子必多，所要來的都是虛空。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["對年輕人的忠告"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["少年人哪，你在幼年時當快樂。在幼年的日子，使你的心歡暢，行你心所願行的，看你眼所愛看的；卻要知道，為這一切的事，上帝必審問你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["所以，你當從心中除掉愁煩，從肉體克去邪惡；因為一生的開端和幼年之時，都是虛空的。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}